- $ \Delta H_{\text{vap}} = 32,000 \, \text{J/mol} $  
- $ R = 8.314 \, \text{J/(mol·K)} $  

**Step 1:** Calculate the temperature difference term:  
$$
\frac{1}{T_1} - \frac{1}{T_2} = \frac{1}{296.15} - \frac{1}{311.15} \approx -0.0001627 \, \text{K}^{-1}
